02:58:05.291 --> 02:58:10.583
Today I stare death in the eye

02:58:10.833 --> 02:58:16.000
Today I stare death in the eye

02:58:16.083 --> 02:58:19.750
Only one will survive
It will either be me

02:58:19.833 --> 02:58:24.583
